  "translation": "Today is Saturday, the weather is very good. I go to the park with my friend. In the morning, I first get up, then eat breakfast. My home is north of the park, so we take the bus. In the park, I saw many flowers and trees, and also birds. The birds are singing in the trees, very pleasant. My friend can take photos, he took many photos for me. At noon, we felt very hungry, so we went to eat at a restaurant next to the park. The restaurant's dishes were delicious, we ordered rice, fish, and eggs. While eating, we drank a cup of milk tea. In the afternoon, we went to watch a movie. The cinema is inside the shopping mall, not far from the park. We bought tickets and then went in. The movie was very interesting, we all liked it. After watching the movie, we strolled around the mall. I bought a piece of new clothes, my friend bought a book. In the evening, we went home. Today is really happy! I often play with my friend, we play happily."
